    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Dearrat Debs.\nSaturday\n9/933\nMr T.V. Soong came\nback to Shanghai Earlier\nthan lexpreted and my\nfuend M.y. Tang asked\nme to get out a lot of\nreport. on which 9 haor\nter working very very\nhard. Lats last night\nand all today. On tog\nof that o hair to mail\nall reporto to Niry. on\nthe Manila suror, - so\nthis wick and I have lot.\nof work\nto do which",
      "suits me anyway for\nattnwin o get ticke\nblus. Am\nnot forgittin\nyour arci not to work\ntoo hard.\nAm goung out\ntongst with the gueran\narnolds and some frends\nfor Chimes dinin - slon\nChince food - and sleep\nlats tomorrow Q.m. Then\ntomorrow night I han\ndiman with the Amencan\nconse to the\nHolidays\n12 i toron\nthat night on thai way\nto gapan.\nDwight B.",
      "is to be thrus too.\nt a long litte\nvile sad to you-\nstinke 9\nDont on\nmight sind her some\nof thon horses like Bo\nhas - they\nand very cheap\nand the comed adors\nthim - dont you think!\nLets and lots of\nwright groan\n- 165 (but vir,\nlight clothes toge you\nOne up to par and acrurd\nintrinst too as Ever yours\nBix"
